Hello Luis,

I've already got one running.  All of the sites resolve just fine, but =
they just won't actually load the pages.  I ran ethereal and compared =
the client traffic to the traffic generated by the firewall box itself, =
and the only (effective) differences I saw was the HTTP reply to the =
HTTP GET request never even reached the ppp0 interface when the clients =
were connecting.

Ryan



